# Node-RED 预装插件列表
# 每行一个 npm 包名，可带版本号（如 node-red-node-mysql@1.0.3）
# 以 # 开头的行为注释，空行会被忽略

# ===== UI / 仪表盘 =====
@flowfuse/node-red-dashboard

# ===== 工业协议 =====
node-red-contrib-modbus
node-red-contrib-opcua
node-red-contrib-s7
node-red-contrib-cip-ethernet-ip
node-red-contrib-open-protocol-desoutter

# ===== 数据库 =====
node-red-node-mysql
node-red-contrib-postgresql
node-red-node-sqlite

# ===== 通用工具 =====
node-red-contrib-cron-plus
node-red-node-email
node-red-contrib-buffer-parser
node-red-contrib-tail-file

# ===== 消息中间件 =====
node-red-contrib-kafkajs
